      "answer": "I’ll inventory the Task Tracker fixture and trace every requested data path before editing, with particular attention to the two store/index boundary defects. Then I’ll apply the cross-file refactor and run all three required root scripts.\nThe fixture already contains partial priority and filtering scaffolding. Exact reads confirm the two defects are at the requested boundaries: `addTask` removes the date after factory validation, and `updateTask` refreshes the index before mutating status/priority/tags; I’m now completing the usage inventory before changing those boundaries.\nI’m applying one coherent refactor: make `Task.priority` structurally required with a factory default, rename the date field and CLI option to `deadline`, persist the built task unchanged, and refresh index metadata only after mutations. Tests will exercise direct-store and CLI deadline persistence, all three filters, index updates, invalid priorities, and past/malformed deadlines.\nThe refactor is in place, and an exact filesystem search finds no remaining `dueDate` or `--due-date` references in the fixture. I’m switching to the required validation scripts now; any test or type failure will be fixed before completion.\nAll required validations pass: nine Task Tracker tests, a clean TypeScript no-emit check, and CLI help showing `--deadline` plus all three list filters. No follow-up fixes were needed.\nImplemented deadline renaming, required/default priority, indexed filters, deadline validation, and both store/index defect fixes.\n\n**Changed Files**\n- `games/task-tracker/src/core/task.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/core/taskFactory.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/store/taskStore.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/store/taskIndex.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/cli/parser.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/cli/commands.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/cli/main.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/format/compact.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/src/format/display.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/test/fixtures.ts`\n- `games/task-tracker/test/task-tracker.test.ts`\n\n**Validation**\n- `npm run task-tracker:test`: passed, 9/9 tests.\n- `npm run task-tracker:typecheck`: passed with no diagnostics.\n- `npm run task-tracker:run -- --help`: passed; displays `--deadline`, `--status`, `--priority`, and `--tag`.\n- Fixture search for `dueDate` or `--due-date`: no matches.",
